  "details": "So the \"Create Group\" button get's disabled when you create too many groups in a short amount of time.\n\nHowever this does not seem to reflect the actual api timeout of group creation. \n\nFrom my own testing it seems to have a 24h timeout after a certain amount of group creations.\n\nHowever this timeout is not reflected by the button grayout. Instead the creation process will be stuck in the last stage.",
